        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu ūbafuuha alīhaya gīkī, “Bbyalanagi mukwīle, ng'wīyookaje ī sī ng'wīsuge. Nī ndīlo ja mu nyanza mujisuge, pyī nī noni ja hape; nī shiseeng'wa shipanga ī shose īsho shilī mu sī.” ",
          "type": "text",
