              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ū Mulungu ūbawīla gīkī, “Nang'winhaga pyī ī sha mu sī īsho shikazwaaga na kūtwaja matwajo, nī mitī ya shisuumo pye ī yose. Shikūbiza shilīwa shing'we, ",
          "type": "text",
